# Cloud-agent Linear handoff

Canonical detail: **`docs/cloud-agent-linear-handoff.md`**.

Emit a copy-paste **local-agent Linear handoff** only when this session is a Cloud Agent /
background / remote agent **and** it **implemented a plan to completion** **and** **merged** that
implementation PR, and Linear was not updated in-session. A local agent with Linear MCP `ready`
applies slice **Done** + merge comment. GitHub PR linkbacks do not replace Linear.

## Do not emit when

- the PR is still open;
- the merge is planning-only or does not satisfy slice acceptance;
- harvest / triage with no implementation merge.

## After implementation merge (phase B)

Write the payload in phase B closeout only (not a post-merge slice-doc edit on `main`): issue IDs;
slice **Done** (or **do not change**); parent Backlog unless full parent shipped; verbatim comment
(PR URL + what shipped + validation); **Do not** list; already-posted flag.

## Local agent

Apply verbatim. Skip duplicates with the same PR URL and facts.
